{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "schinese", "appid": 548430, "month": "2026-03", "window": 2, "start_date": 1773014400, "end_date": 1773619199, "month_true_total": 243, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 22:02:44 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "220772408", "author": {"steamid": "76561199877894304", "personaname": "naishk", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199877894304/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 817, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 598, "last_played": 1778022575, "avatar": "41bbc7ebb715d936dbd015600e0aba4656485f86"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "刷怪挖矿太符合我和兄弟的解压追求了", "timestamp_created": 1773605057, "timestamp_updated": 1773605057, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "220748173", "author": {"steamid": "76561199373973002", "personaname": "令牌干什么吃的😅", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199373973002/", "num_games_owned": 27, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 10706, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7104, "last_played": 1778915173, "avatar": "d519a586ec6dc23a49f2ff17426bcdcd2fc074d2"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "不错的   除了氧气稀薄的任务（我阐述你的梦哪个天才设计的恶心到起飞的任务\n", "timestamp_created": 1773586581, "timestamp_updated": 1774719731, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "220732350", "author": {"steamid": "76561198849025768", "personaname": "干饭超人", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198849025768/", "num_games_owned": 114, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 68900, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 50918, "last_played": 1785578542, "avatar": "97e463a36f2693f6158631fb69c4074694019c20"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "第六赛季更新，唯一值得夸赞的就是第六赛季更新的[b]“柴油动力”[/b]系列武器框架，免费的优质皮肤\n听说是外包做的，都是[b]屎[/b]，最明显的特征就是新虫子[h1]不符合定位的血量[/h1]\n\n1. 新的小飞虫没有虫限，战士的血量，机械水母灵活度和大小，满地刷\n2. 蚁狮更是牛逼，禁卫血量的地面水蛭，还会转移位置\n3. 新地图挺好看的，风格很好，但是被新的虫子毁掉了，[b]我和小伙伴都不玩这张图[/b]\n4. 新模式不好玩，又臭又长的模式，缺少趣味性，没有任何距离提示且可以放在犄角旮旯\n这个赛季的钻机更是牢中之牢，选了就坐牢，可以直接删除掉钻机了，把幸存者里要更新的新职业搬过来得了\n本人及一起玩的小伙伴对这次的更新大失所望，对游戏的娱乐性没有任何的提升，反而降低了所有玩家对游戏的积极性\n翻阅中国的相关游戏社区，甚至没有人说过能[h2]接受此次的更新内容[/h2]\n如果鬼船往后的更新内容都会延续此次的风格，我建议停止更新并退档到第五赛季\n[h1]不要让你拉的新狗屎毁掉了一个我很热爱的游戏[/h1]", "timestamp_created": 1773573061, "timestamp_updated": 1773573061, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545454561710357666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "220718098", "author": {"steamid": "76561199721884166", "personaname": "活着不玩不如死", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199721884166/", "num_games_owned": 29, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 183, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 27, "last_played": 1773566219, "avatar": "084af891daa18ba206ff6cf6bf399b4233377b2b"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "1", "timestamp_created": 1773556988, "timestamp_updated": 1773556988, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_re